{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/5c11cb6f2c2a00ca30b5e58b03c4754b.poster.avif?t=1761717086\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/5c11cb6f2c2a00ca30b5e58b03c4754b.webm?t=1761717086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Dungeons, find loot, customize your character and face monsters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/619b1f53c520e8beb90aea097d47cba4.webp?t=1761717086\" width=600 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where monsters were banished long ago, <i>something</i> has caused them to reemerge, and it's up to you, <strong>the Hero</strong>, to rid the world of monsters and defeat the <strong>Great Eternal Dragon</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Mori</strong> is a game inspired by the classic <i>Dungeon Crawlers</i> and\u00a0<i>Old School</i>\u00a0<i>RPGs</i>. With a simple, yet addicting gameplay, it features a turn based battle system combined with a choice based dungeon exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/eb73bcb48a395494d556505294aa3718.webp?t=1761717086\" width=600 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/a40f8ddfb0cc34c28f8ec4c1d788537a.poster.avif?t=1761717086\" width=408 height=306 ><source src=